hā-kṛṣṇa jugala-milan","ārati karaye lalitādi sakhī-goṇ"],"translation":["All glories, all glories to the meeting of the transcendental couple, Śrī Śrī Rādhā Krishna. The gopīs headed by Lalitā devī perform the ceremony of their worship."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["madana-mohana rūpa tri-bhaṅga-sundara","pītāmbara śikhi-pucha-chūḍā-manohara"],"translation":["Krishna is the attractor of Cupid, and His beautiful form is bending in three places with yellow garments and a charming peacock-feather crown."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["lalita-mādhava-bāme vṛṣabhānu-kanyā","nīla-basanā gaurī rūpe guṇe dhanyā"],"translation":["Dressed in blue garments, Her complexion fair, and Her virtues glorious, King Vṛṣabhānu’s daughter, Śrīmatī Rādhikā is on the left of the charming Lord Mādhava."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["nānā-bidha alaṅkāra kore jhalamala","hari-mano-bimohana vadana ujjvala"],"translation":["Her various ornaments sparkle and Her effulgent face charms the heart of Lord Krishna."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["viśākhādi sakhī-goṇ nānā rāge gāya","priya-narma-sakhī jata chāmāra ḍhulāya"],"translation":["Viśākhā and the other girls sing songs in various tunes and moods as Krishna’s intimate playful girlfriends fan the divine couple with whisks."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["śrī-rādhā-mādhava-pada-sarasija-āśe","bhakativinoda sakhī-pade sukhe bhāse"],"translation":["Yearning to attain the lotus feet of Śrī Śrī Rādhā-Krishna, Bhakti Vinod floats in happiness at the gopīs’ feet."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/jaya-jaya-radha-krishna","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/jaya-jaya-radha-krishna-jugala-milan/","description":"Śrī Jugala-ārati — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti 